WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.497
Warning! Warning!

2
00:00:01.497 --> 00:00:06.705
I built this with AI and text to speech, because I can't narrate for shit!

3
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.472
Hey, Dreamer here.

4
00:00:09.472 --> 00:00:14.044
Today, traits, part one: the pages of the character creator.

5
00:00:15.433 --> 00:00:18.769
Open Mechanics, then Traits, then Trait Categories.

6
00:00:18.769 --> 00:00:22.825
Traits are the picks players make when they build a character,

7
00:00:22.825 --> 00:00:25.768
and each category is one page of the creator.

8
00:00:25.768 --> 00:00:28.123
We've got two: Background, then Act.

9
00:00:28.567 --> 00:00:32.026
The description is shown to players above the category.

10
00:00:32.026 --> 00:00:35.486
Say what the choice means, or that picking is optional.

11
00:00:35.933 --> 00:00:40.563
Max selections is how many traits a player can take from this page,

12
00:00:40.563 --> 00:00:43.119
anywhere from none up to this number.

13
00:00:43.119 --> 00:00:47.334
One makes it a single choice, and zero blocks the whole page.

14
00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:50.553
The traits list is what's on the page.

15
00:00:50.553 --> 00:00:56.929
A trait has no category setting of its own: it lands in a category by being listed here.

16
00:00:56.929 --> 00:01:01.349
Act's own list is empty, because every act sits in a section.

17
00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Subcategories split the page into sections players can fold away.

18
00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.076
Act has two, in the ring and around the show.

19
00:01:09.076 --> 00:01:12.516
Anything left in the main list shows up under Other.

20
00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:14.900
Order matters.

21
00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:17.512
The pages come in the order of the list,

22
00:01:17.512 --> 00:01:23.715
and when a trait is locked or unlocked by another one, the creator only looks at earlier pages.

23
00:01:23.715 --> 00:01:25.935
That's why Background comes first.

24
00:01:25.935 --> 00:01:27.437
More on that next time.

25
00:01:28.833 --> 00:01:31.969
And remember, attributes only come from traits.

26
00:01:31.969 --> 00:01:36.774
Ours start at eight, and each act lifts its main attribute up to twelve,

27
00:01:36.774 --> 00:01:40.710
which is exactly what its move from episode fourteen needs.

28
00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.935
That's the creator's pages.

29
00:01:43.935 --> 00:01:46.721
Our traits are linked in the description.

30
00:01:46.721 --> 00:01:50.459
Next time, traits part two: what a trait actually does.

31
00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:54.848
I'm Dreamer. Now go build something weird, and I'll see you next time!

